WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:02.520
Section nine.

00:00:03.963 --> 00:00:05.563
Generation and validation.

00:00:07.347 --> 00:00:10.067
The purpose is to turn the assembled context into

00:00:10.067 --> 00:00:11.107
a bounded proposal,

00:00:11.747 --> 00:00:14.027
then check it before it affects organization.

00:00:16.110 --> 00:00:18.550
Valid JSON is only the beginning of that check.

00:00:27.950 --> 00:00:31.530
In the preserved Orion call, the model selected Orion

00:00:31.530 --> 00:00:32.510
Clinical Platform,

00:00:33.490 --> 00:00:34.130
Web APIs,

00:00:34.950 --> 00:00:36.630
FastAPI, and Python.

00:00:37.419 --> 00:00:39.919
All four assignments cited evidence one.

00:00:41.307 --> 00:00:42.867
Forge and Package Management were omitted.

00:00:44.336 --> 00:00:47.836
The request counted seven hundred sixty input tokens and

00:00:47.836 --> 00:00:50.116
returned one hundred ninety-five output tokens.

00:00:51.345 --> 00:00:55.045
This visible result does not expose the model's private

00:00:55.045 --> 00:00:56.145
reasoning process.

00:01:02.277 --> 00:01:03.797
Validation checks active IDs,

00:01:04.557 --> 00:01:04.777
kinds,

00:01:05.437 --> 00:01:06.137
workspace ownership,

00:01:06.737 --> 00:01:07.517
allowed candidates,

00:01:08.477 --> 00:01:09.757
duplicates, field limits,

00:01:10.577 --> 00:01:12.037
status, and evidence references.

00:01:12.957 --> 00:01:15.537
Dispatch and commit also check access,

00:01:16.417 --> 00:01:16.897
profile hashes,

00:01:17.757 --> 00:01:19.277
revisions, and user decisions.

00:01:21.077 --> 00:01:22.997
Suggestions remain proposals until accepted.

00:01:24.177 --> 00:01:27.677
A real evidence ID may still cite irrelevant prose,

00:01:27.677 --> 00:01:30.537
and the model's confidence is not a calibrated accuracy

00:01:30.537 --> 00:01:31.257
probability.

00:01:36.480 --> 00:01:39.700
Luna is the task default supported by the limited

00:01:39.700 --> 00:01:41.000
classification tests;

00:01:41.680 --> 00:01:43.640
Sol supplied the taxonomy draft.

00:01:45.050 --> 00:01:48.230
A comprehensive model-winner study was not completed.

00:01:50.120 --> 00:01:53.940
The audit also found evidence-ID validation broader than the

00:01:53.940 --> 00:01:57.640
transmitted compact set, and a taxonomy prompt limit of

00:01:57.640 --> 00:02:00.460
twenty versus a validator limit of fifty.

00:02:02.010 --> 00:02:04.970
Those are improvement tasks, not shipped guarantees.
